---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Guidelines | Shellui
description: Writing, web design, and composition rules for Shellui. Versioned markdown that agents and humans share.
hideBreadcrumbs: true
---

<article class="su-section-band page-top page-x pb-20">
  {% set wireframeBandWidth = "5xl" %}
  {% include "su-wireframe-band-top.njk" %}
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl su-column-box su-frame-corners px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 sm:py-10">
    {% include "su-frame-marks.njk" %}
    {% include "guidelines-subnav.njk" %}

    <header>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 md:text-5xl dark:text-white">Guidelines</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        Voice, UI, and composition rules for Shellui. Writing and web design are markdown on the page. Design is a visual handbook; agents still fetch the lean file.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
        Logos and press-kit files stay on <a href="/brand-assets/" class="text-primary-ink underline hover:opacity-90 dark:text-primary">brand assets</a>.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-10 divide-y divide-gray-200 border-y border-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-800 dark:border-gray-800">
      {% for item in guidelines.topics %}
        <a href="{{ item.href }}" class="group flex flex-col gap-2 py-6 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between sm:gap-8">
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{{ item.navLabel }}</h2>
              <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tabular-nums text-gray-700 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-300">v{{ item.version }}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">{{ item.hubDescription }}</p>
            {% if item.publicUrl == '/design.md' %}
              <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">fetch https://shellui.com/design.md</p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <span class="shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink group-hover:underline dark:text-primary">Read {{ item.navLabel | lower }}</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/5">
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">For agents</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        Site map for agents: <a href="/llms.txt" class="font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">/llms.txt</a>.
        Building a page? Fetch <a href="/design.md" class="font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">https://shellui.com/design.md</a> first, then the topic skill. Do not scrape HTML.
      </p>
      <pre class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-950 dark:text-gray-200"># 1. Fetch the composition file
https://shellui.com/design.md

# 2. Then load the parent skill from this repo
{{ guidelines.parentSkillPath }}</pre>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        {% for item in guidelines.topics %}
          <li>
            <span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{{ item.navLabel }}</span>:
            <code class="font-mono text-[0.8rem]">{{ item.skillPath }}</code>
            →
            <code class="font-mono text-[0.8rem]">{{ item.sourcePath }}</code>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
